YOU ARE INVITED
to the Long-expected Party
of Mr. Bilbo Baggins (eleventy-one) and Mr. Frodo Baggins (thirty-three)

Date: the twenty-second of September
Place: the Party Field, below Bag End
Time: from noon until the fireworks stop

Food: yes, a great deal.
Fireworks: by a well-known wizard; please stand back.
Speech: short (the host promises).

Dress: festive. Hats encouraged.
Presents: none required; the host gives presents on his birthday.

RSVP to Bag End by the first of September.
Sackville-Bagginses: please do not bring measuring tapes.
